surname>Greenfield</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Keays</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Brady</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Spurr</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Gray</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Hunter</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Brown</surname><given-names>SDM</given-names></name><name><surname>Cox</surname><given-names>RD</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A gene-driven ENU-based approach to generating an allelic series in any gene</article-title><source>Mamm Genome</source><year>2004</year><volume>15</volume><fpage>585</fpage><lpage>591</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15457338</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/s00335-004-2379-z</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Augustin</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Sedlmeier</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Peters</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Huffstadt</surname><given-names>U</given-names></name><name><surname>Kochmann</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Simon</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Sch&#x000f6;niger</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Garke-Mayerthaler</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Laufs</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Mayhaus</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Franke</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Klose</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Graupner</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Kurzmann</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Zinser</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Wolf</surn